  "$Comment": "Mob Battle training dagger fighter: the training knight's role (mannequin body, Neutral, fights what a battle turns it against within 30 blocks) with iron daggers in both hands and no shield. CAE_MobBattle_Dummy_Daggers gives it the player's dagger attacks: the swing and stab combo, the pounce and the Razorstrike signature. Keeps 1.2-1.8 blocks from its target (dagger reach 2). No armor. Keeps 1-1.7 blocks from its rival: the daggers combo reaches 2, and at the knight's 2-3 it only pounced. Circles its rival in short bursts (0.6-1.2 s every 1.5-3 s, 1-1.8 s every 0.8-1.6 s in Strafe) and turns its head quicker (0.7): two dagger fighters circling nonstop never got their aim on each other.",
